{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48852","headline":"赋得福州白竹扇子 · 张祜","name":"赋得福州白竹扇子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金泥小扇谩多情，未胜南工巧织成。\n藤缕雪光缠柄滑，篾铺银薄露花轻。\n清风坐向罗衫起，明月看从玉手生。\n犹赖早时君不弃，每怜初作合欢名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}